### § 7. FF.6 — Checkpoint 达成庆祝动画（正反馈终极版）

单独成节，因为这是与用户体验最直接相关的功能。

#### 7.1 confetti 库

将 `canvas-confetti` v1.9.3 minified 版本下载到本地：
```
taskvm/workspace_ui/static/confetti.min.js
```
（直接从 https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/canvas-confetti@1.9.3/dist/confetti.browser.min.js 下载，约 7KB，存本地以避免外网依赖）

#### 7.2 庆祝逻辑

在 `timeline.js` 末尾（或单独的 `celebrate.js`）实现：

```javascript
function celebrateCheckpoint(checkpointName) {
  // 1. confetti 从两侧射出
  confetti({ particleCount: 120, spread: 70, origin: {x: 0.2, y: 0.6} });
  confetti({ particleCount: 120, spread: 70, origin: {x: 0.8, y: 0.6} });
  
  // 2. 中央 badge 弹出
  var badge = document.createElement("div");
  badge.className = "checkpoint-badge";
  badge.innerHTML = "<span class='ckpt-icon'>✅</span><span class='ckpt-name'>" 
                    + checkpointName + "</span><span class='ckpt-sub'>里程碑达成</span>";
  document.body.appendChild(badge);
  
  // 3. 弹簧动画：scale 0 → 1.1 → 1
  badge.style.transform = "scale(0)";
  requestAnimationFrame(function() {
    badge.style.transition = "transform .4s cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1)";
    badge.style.transform = "scale(1)";
  });
  
  // 4. 2.5 秒后淡出消失
  setTimeout(function() {
    badge.style.transition = "opacity .3s, transform .3s";
    badge.style.opacity = "0";
    badge.style.transform = "scale(0.9)";
    setTimeout(function() { document.body.removeChild(badge); }, 300);
  }, 2500);
}
```

触发时机：
1. `POST /<sid>/checkpoint` 响应 JSON 里含 `"milestone_reached": {"id": "C1", "name": "会议+任务同步"}` → 前端调用 `celebrateCheckpoint(name)`
2. `POST /<sid>/adopt_milestone` 响应 JSON 里同样可以触发（用户主动采纳里程碑时）

